WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.920 line:86%
Now the Video tab,

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.220 line:86%
which is very simple.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.659 line:86%
First you'll need one or two

00:00:05.699 --> 00:00:07.426 line:86%
already rendered images of

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:08.400 line:86%
your project.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.973 line:86%
I'll use this project here as

00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:10.916 line:86%
an example.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.126 line:86%
In here we have two fields,

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:16.540 line:86%
the Initial Frame and the Final Frame.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.530 line:86%
You can load two images at once,

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.480 line:86%
or just one image in the Initial

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.200 line:86%
Frame.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.245 line:86%
And if you want,

00:00:22.285 --> 00:00:24.138 line:86%
in this option you can choose

00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:25.640 line:86%
the video with audio or

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.360 line:86%
without audio.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.220 line:86%
You can also pick some preset

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.800 line:86%
settings for your video.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.317 line:86%
If you want a transition from

00:00:32.357 --> 00:00:33.916 line:86%
one image to another, you'll need

00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:35.300 line:86%
to load both images.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.864 line:86%
Now if you just want to create

00:00:36.904 --> 00:00:38.384 line:86%
movement, load a single image in

00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:39.436 line:86%
the Initial Frame.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.651 line:86%
In this example we'll use one

00:00:41.691 --> 00:00:43.606 line:86%
image during the day and another

00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:45.733 line:86%
at night, and ask the tool to create

00:00:45.773 --> 00:00:46.636 line:86%
a timelapse.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.783 line:86%
It's important to write in

00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:50.754 line:86%
the text field what you're imagining

00:00:50.794 --> 00:00:51.627 line:86%
for your video.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.833 line:86%
If you leave it blank,

00:00:52.873 --> 00:00:54.029 line:86%
the AI may not understand

00:00:54.069 --> 00:00:55.847 line:86%
exactly what you want to create.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.659 line:86%
Now in this example,

00:01:31.699 --> 00:01:33.230 line:86%
I'll show you how to generate

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.361 line:86%
a video using only the Initial Frame.

00:01:35.401 --> 00:01:36.979 line:86%
Here you can ask the AI

00:01:37.019 --> 00:01:39.890 line:86%
to create some kind of movement, or even

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.986 line:86%
add elements happening in your scene.

